              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ALISSAKIRKLEY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I added some shredded chicken and we had a complete meal! So very good.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-08T14:16:18.937Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "apcudney"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this yummy and easy-to-make soup today for a family gathering. I doubled the recipe and it did not fit into my standard-size crock pot, so I simmered it on the stove on LOW for 2 hours in a large soup pot stirring often. It turned out very good and my family already requested it for another meal. I may change up the veggies and use just broccoli instead.",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-02T17:57:59.180Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dale Bona"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a wonderful comfort soup! I got rave reviews.",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-09T13:44:07.223Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer A"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used 2 pounds of asparagus instead of 1 pound of mixed veggies (just my personal choice). It turned out awesome! I used the slow cooker on high for 2 1/2 hours, but I'm sure it's because I didn't cube the cheese small enough. Outstanding flavor - my children even liked it! This will definitely become a favorite of mine!",
            "datePublished": "2007-02-17T13:21:04.760Z"
          }
